          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best protein powder for weight loss is not a special diet formula. It is a plain, protein-dense powder, ideally 80 to 90 percent protein by calories or better, with little sugar and a flavor you will keep drinking. For most people that means a whey isolate such as Dymatize ISO100 or Isopure Zero Carb; for dairy-free dieters, a dense pea protein; and for people who will not mix anything, a low-sugar ready-to-drink shake.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
